# 7. REST API Documentation

## 7.1 User APIs (/api/users)

### Register User

POST /api/users

### Login User

POST /api/users/login

### Get User Profile

GET /api/users/profile

### Get All Users (Admin)

GET /api/users

### Approve User (Admin)

PUT /api/users/:id/approve

### Admin Statistics

GET /api/users/stats/admin

---

## 7.2 Donation APIs (/api/donations)

### Create Donation

POST /api/donations

### Browse Donations

GET /api/donations

### Get My Donations

GET /api/donations/mydonations

### Get Donation Details

GET /api/donations/:id

### Confirm Pickup

PUT /api/donations/:id/pickup

### Confirm Delivery

PUT /api/donations/:id/deliver

### Donation Statistics

GET /api/donations/stats/[role]

---

## 7.3 Request APIs (/api/requests)

### Request Food

POST /api/requests

### Get My Requests

GET /api/requests/myrequests

### Get All Requests

GET /api/requests/all

### Approve/Reject Request

PUT /api/requests/:id

---

## 7.4 Notification APIs (/api/notifications)

### Get Notifications

GET /api/notifications

### Unread Notification Count

GET /api/notifications/unread-count

### Mark Notification as Read

PUT /api/notifications/:id/read

